ts of intersection between this  green and blue graph  you can actually see by plotting on here  and here these are the particular points  of intersection between them  and because if we move a around you can  see i'm going to keep it positive  because  a and b they initially want us to  restrict it to positive  if i move a you can see it changes the  shape of my hyperbola i  change its kind of scale or it's sort of  stretchiness right  but every time you like no matter how  far you move i mean my  mind max is out of 10 but you could make  it anything you like it's going to keep  on moving  outwards and it will always have these  two  points of intersection between the green  and the red graphs no matter which way  you know however far you change these  numbers you're still going to get those  points of intersection  right

